# every check and tool the gate runs, in one binary, chosen by its first argument:
#
#     haxelib run hx68k gate <program> [arguments]
#
# Thirty separate builds of the same sources cost more to rebuild than one, so a program that needs
# no window lives here rather than in a target of its own. Adding one means adding run(args) to it
# and a case in hx68k.test.Gate.
-cp src
-main hx68k.test.Gate
-cpp ../export/md/tests/obj/gate

# the same three the emulator is built with, so a check measures the build that ships
-D analyzer-optimize
-D HXCPP_OPTIMIZE_LINK
-D HXCPP_GC_GENERATIONAL
